{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28070","headline":"宿黄花馆 · 杨发","name":"宿黄花馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤馆萧条槐叶稀，暮蝉声隔水声微。\n年年爲客路无尽，日日送人身未归。\n何处迷鸿离浦月，谁家愁妇捣霜衣。\n夜深不卧帘犹卷，数点残萤入户飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}